# Albin Reji — Full Stack Developer Portfolio

Build a production-quality, visually distinctive personal portfolio for Albin Reji using the existing Next.js 16 + Tailwind CSS v4 + TypeScript setup.

## Existing Project State

The workspace at `c:\A_Drive\albin-reji\portfolio` already has:
- Next.js 16.3.2 with App Router (`src/app/`)
- React 19, TypeScript 5 (strict mode)
- Tailwind CSS v4 via `@tailwindcss/postcss`
- ESLint with `eslint-config-next`
- Path alias `@/*` → `./src/*`

**Missing dependencies to install:**
- `framer-motion` — viewport reveals, stagger animations, hero entrance
