## Design Direction

Inspired by reference sites (Kuon Yagi's full-page elegance, Aristide Benoist's dark #141414 + monochrome + bold type, Zhenya Rynzhuk's large serif typography + motion), creating an **original** dark-first design:

| Token | Value |
|---|---|
| Background | `#0a0a0a` (near-black) |
| Surface | `#111111` |
| Border | `rgba(255,255,255,0.08)` |
| Primary text | `#f0f0f0` (off-white) |
| Secondary text | `#888888` (muted) |
| Accent | `#60a5fa` (technical blue) |
| Accent hover | `#93c5fd` |
| Font display | Inter (sans) |
| Font mono | Geist Mono / monospace fallback |

